  "body": "I haven't tested wether the preview spider supports IPv6, but if it does (and probably even if it doesn't so there's no bad surprises when it does) the local and loopback and [ULU/ULA](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/IPv6#Unique_Local_Unicast) and so on should be included in the example.\r\n\r\nWhat comes to mind would be `::1/128`, `fe80::/64` and `fc00::/7`.",
